<title>EGYPT: Egypt bourse closes to mark new fiscal year.</title>
<headline>Egypt bourse closes to mark new fiscal year.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's stock exchange closed on Tuesday as did the Central Bank and state banks to mark the beginning of the government's new financial year.</p>
<p>--Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
